2. The file hashing function:

```php
class FileController extends Controller {
    public function getMd5Hash(Request $request) {
        $this->validate($request, [
            'file' => 'required|file',
        ]);

        $path = $request->file('file')->getRealPath();
        $md5  = hash_init('md5');

        try {
            $handle = fopen($path, "r");

            while (!feof($handle)) {
                $data   = fread($handle, 8192); // read in chunks to save memory
                hash_update($md5, $data);
            }

            $hash = hash_final($md5);

            return response()->json([
                'status'  => 'success', 
                'message' => 'MD5 Hash calculated successfully.',
                'hash'    => $hash,
            ]);
        } catch (Exception $e) {
            return response()->json([
                'status'  => 'error', 
                'message' => $e->getMessage(),
            ], 500);
        } finally {
            fclose($handle); // close file handle
        }
    }
}
```
