Next, it reads the version of the file (to be implemented according to your requirements) and throws an exception if it is incompatible with the expected version. Finally, it deserializes the data from the file using a binary formatter and returns it as `CustomDataStructure` object. The main method catches any exceptions thrown during these operations and prints their messages.

